={lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{{2}^{x+h+2y}-{2}^{x+2y}}{h}).\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186278230 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "383e0bc9-03cf-5a8c-863c-225af3392d9f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x-h+3y)+\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186275974} {:answer/id #uuid "7945ffd3-5f05-5457-a797-f97318f811fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{h\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276578} {:answer/id #uuid "b0c9179d-e8b2-536c-b20f-6906f6eca321" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186277058} {:answer/id #uuid "c35e4727-2498-5dca-8178-4436cb00df14" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186277214} {:answer/id #uuid "dda4715e-bd12-5ebe-bfef-6060557727a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(xh+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186277419}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c35e4727-2498-5dca-8178-4436cb00df14" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186277214} :answer-field/id #uuid "c4ece284-f8fe-594e-b804-399bb52c5e8b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186278071}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fdf020b6-22cb-53d4-9f16-5ef52a2ed3d5" :question/math-academy-id "q-159579" :question/problem "Given that $f(x,y)=\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y),$ then $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=$" :question/worked-solution "The partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $x$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}={lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{f(x+h,y)-f(x,y)}{h}).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y),$  we have that \n\n$$\nf(x+h,y)=\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}={lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h}).\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186278232 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "17151a6a-94bf-55a7-a13b-683abbbb3201" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y-h+2)^{3}}+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186275693} {:answer/id #uuid "88bb8931-3ab4-597f-ac73-5223c606f67e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{(x+h)^{2}}{(y+h+2)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276712} {:answer/id #uuid "8b258731-5747-557a-bf41-f3eb922a6546" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+h+2)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276738} {:answer/id #uuid "c9b7a87b-e2a5-587c-b8eb-c96fc0270fe8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2h)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186277269} {:answer/id #uuid "d7dbfd03-ca32-5bda-a9d7-8c6f0318343c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{(x+h)^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186277376}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8b258731-5747-557a-bf41-f3eb922a6546" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+h+2)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276738} :answer-field/id #uuid "a188f0c3-15f8-5c12-aa43-1dce2bcf1a25" :answer-field/key "selection" :answ